&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;"&gt;(注)１．普通株式の消却に伴う発行済株式総数の減少であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　２．公募による新株式発行に伴う発行済株式総数、資本金及び資本準備金の増加であります。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　発行価格　　　　　  2,097円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　発行価額　　　　 2,010.52円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　資本組入額　　　 1,005.26円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_anno1" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:left;padding-left:36pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-justify:inter-ideograph;text-indent:-27pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:12pt;font-size:9pt;"&gt;　　　　払込金総額　　120,631百万円&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p class="smt_text6" style="orphans:0;widows:0;text-align:justify;padding-left:0pt;padding-right:0pt;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;text-indent:0pt;font-family:&amp;apos;ＭＳ 明朝&amp;apos;;letter-spacing:0pt;line-height:15pt;font-size:15pt;"&gt; &lt;/p&gt;</jpcrp_cor:ChangesInNumberOfIssuedSharesStatedCapitalEtcTextBlock>
